# Example config for deepseek-harness-launcher.
# Copy to ~/.config/deepseek-harness-launcher/config and uncomment what you need.
# Format: KEY=value, full-line '#' comments only, last occurrence wins.
# A leading ~/ is expanded to your home folder; surrounding double quotes are stripped.
# An empty quoted value (KEY="") counts as unset and falls back to the default.
#
# SERVER_PORT=3080
# WORKSPACE=~/.dsh/workspace
# LOG_FILE=~/Library/Logs/DeepSeek Harness.log
# DSH_COMMAND=npx -y @deepseek-ai/dsh web --no-open
# NOTE: the launcher appends --port 0 unless DSH_COMMAND already sets --port
# (the window opens the scraped server URL directly).
